{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/911927-altered-alternate-form-gifts","id":911927,"title":"Altered/Alternate form gifts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-06-10T15:35:27-07:00","id":911927,"title":"Altered/Alternate form gifts","content":"I was wondering if anyone had a list of all the gifts for various changing breeds that allow them to assume additional or altered forms.<br /> <br /> For example, the Ananasi gift Man-Spider form that lets them take a Glabro equivalent, or the Camazotz gift in Changing Breeds w20 that let them take a swarm form instead of a single giant bat.<br /> <br /> I had no luck checking wikis.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T16:27:36-07:00","id":911954,"title":"","content":"How broad are you looking for regarding &quot;altered&quot; forms?<br /> <br /> The additional form as per those two examples are pretty rare (I'm not sure of any other examples really). But are altered forms supposed to be new options, or do things like Monkey Tail count wear a Garou can have a prehensile tail in Lupus?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T17:24:48-07:00","id":911986,"title":"","content":"Mostly I'm looking for gifts that add (or permanently alter) a form with fixed stats. <br /> I'd say Monkey Tail counts, since it doesn't cost anything or require a roll to activate nor have a duration, but it's sort of an edge case. <br /> <br /> Gifts that temporarily alter a form are also of interest, things like The Thousand Forms or Gift of the Spriggan.<br /> <br /> Basically I'm looking for gifts to use as a basis for a custom gift, to allow a Mokole to assume the lost Drachid form, and I just want to look at as many similar official gifts as I can to help properly judge the rank for the gift and the level of stat adjustments that are reasonable.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-06-10T19:55:33-07:00","id":912050,"title":"","content":"Spent like 2 hours pouring through my books.<br /> <br /> Man-spider Form, Rank 2, W20 Changing Breed(CB20) p65, Lets Ananasi assume Glabro equivalent<br /> Reptoid Form, Rank 2, CB20 p148, Lets Mokole assume Glabro equivalent<br /> Ratman Form, Rank 3, CB20 p186, Lets Ratkin assume Glabro equivalent<br /> Ratthing Form, Rank 3, CB20 p187, Lets Ratkin assume Hispo equivalent<br /> Thousand Winged Form, Rank 3, CB20 p240, Lets Camazotz assume a flying swarm form (equivalent of Ananasi Crawling form with flying)<br /> Become the Night Jester, Rank 4, CB20 p 54, Lets Ajaba assume a more powerful version of it's Hispo equivalent at night only (ends up being more powerful than it's Crinos)<br /> Small Cousin, Rank 4, CB20 p 88, Lets a Bastet in Feline Form become a domestic house cat instead of it's usual cat form.<br /> <br /> Some of these gifts exist in other books, in slightly different forms, but these are W20 updated and all in one book, so hey!<br /> <br /> Anyway, so there's a list if anyone else is ever looking for it. These gifts all have permanent effects, do not require any gnosis or rage expenditure, and no special rolls (though still require normal shape changing rolls to change form, or spending rage for applicable breeds to change form without a roll...)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/509-tiwaztyrsfist","name":"TiwazTyrsfist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar509_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"162"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}